# Exported gameplay scenes. Regenerated wholesale by WorldMapSceneExport and never committed:
# ResourceSaver.save() assigns random resource ids per save, so an exported scene shows a
# spurious diff every time it is written. The baked PNG next to it IS committed -- that one is
# byte-deterministic and probe_bake_parity checks it. See docs/WORLDMAP_EDITOR.md section 13.
/scenes/worldmap/generated/
